    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young woman who remembers nothing about her past. Waking up almost unclothed in a cold bathtub, you have no idea how you got here. You must uncover the truth, find out why you are here, and reveal the dark secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.poster.avif?t=1745421705\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.webm?t=1745421705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.mp4?t=1745421705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple locations \u2013 more than three areas to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters \u2013 learn their stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings \u2013 your choices shape the outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time changes everything \u2013 events, places, and secrets are only accessible at certain hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/9cffa89c5775b441529c61c8c693eca4.webp?t=1745421705\" width=611 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best played in a dark room with headphones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 40 minutes.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young woman who remembers nothing about her past. Waking up almost unclothed in a cold bathtub, you have no idea how you got here. You must uncover the truth, find out why you are here, and reveal the dark secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.poster.avif?t=1745421705\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.webm?t=1745421705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/14a8db0544f07de9f890f24916bf8166.mp4?t=1745421705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple locations \u2013 more than three areas to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters \u2013 learn their stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings \u2013 your choices shape the outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time changes everything \u2013 events, places, and secrets are only accessible at certain hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405860/extras/9cffa89c5775b441529c61c8c693eca4.webp?t=1745421705\" width=611 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best played in a dark room with headphones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 40 minutes.\u00a0</p>",
